<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Identity Verification Request</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f4f6f9;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#333333;">

  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f4f6f9;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:40px 16px;">

        <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
               style="max-width:600px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;
                      box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);overflow:hidden;">

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#0070d2;padding:28px 40px;">
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:0.5px;">
                Identity Verification Required
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Body -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:40px 40px 32px;">

              <p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;">
                Hi {!Contact.FirstName},
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#444444;">
                As part of our onboarding process, we need to verify your identity. This helps us
                keep your account secure and comply with regulatory requirements.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 28px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#444444;">
                The process is quick and straightforward — it typically takes less than five minutes.
                You will be asked to take a photo of a government-issued ID and a short selfie video.
              </p>

              <!-- CTA button -->
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 auto 32px;">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center"
                      style="background-color:#0070d2;border-radius:4px;padding:14px 32px;">
                    <a href="{!Incode_Verification__c.Verification_URL__c}"
                       style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;
                              font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.3px;display:block;">
                      Verify My Identity
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;color:#888888;">
                If the button above does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 32px;font-size:13px;word-break:break-all;color:#0070d2;">
                {!Incode_Verification__c.Verification_URL__c}
              </p>

              <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;margin:0 0 24px;"/>

              <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#aaaaaa;line-height:1.6;">
                This link is unique to you — please do not share it with others. It will expire
                once you have completed the verification process.
                If you did not expect this email, please contact us immediately.
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#f4f6f9;padding:20px 40px;border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;">
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#aaaaaa;text-align:center;">
                Powered by Incode Identity Verification
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
